> **There is no released GA "LongCat 2.5".** Meituan's LongCat API catalogue lists
> exactly two models: `LongCat-2.0` and the API-only **`LongCat-2.5-Preview`**
> (released 2026-09-25, no published weights, **no published benchmark numbers at
